                      <path
                        d="M9.5 15.5L5.8 11.8L4.4 13.2L9.5 18.3L19.6 8.2L18.2 6.8Z"
                      /></svg></span
                  >Physician consultation & fast shipping included
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="price flex justify-between">
                <div class="text-14-inter dark">Starting at</div>
                <div>
                  <span>$59</span><small class="text-14-inter">/month</small>
                </div>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="global--qua--button w-full"
                ><img
                  class="btn--icon"
                  src="/assets/icons/arrow-right.svg"
                  alt="" loading="lazy" />See if you Quality</button
              >
              <div class="cancel-text">Cancel Anytime</div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="medicine-card"
            >
              <div class="product-image">
                <Image
                  src={image20}
                  alt="Hair Loss"
                />
              </div>
              <h3>Hair Loss</h3>
              <ul class="feature-list mb-6">
                              <li>
                  <span class="list-icon"
                    ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path
                        d="M9.5 15.5L5.8 11.8L4.4 13.2L9.5 18.3L19.6 8.2L18.2 6.8Z"
                      /></svg></span
                  >Synergistic 2-in-1 compounded formula
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="list-icon"
                    ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path
                        d="M9.5 15.5L5.8 11.8L4.4 13.2L9.5 18.3L19.6 8.2L18.2 6.8Z"
                      /></svg></span
                  >Choose between Oral Pill or Topical Spray
                </li>
                <li>
                  <span class="list-icon"
                    ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path
                        d="M9.5 15.5L5.8 11.8L4.4 13.2L9.5 18.3L19.6 8.2L18.2 6.8Z"
                      /></svg></span
                  >Precision-dosed by licensed physicians
                </li>
              </ul>
              <div class="price flex justify-between">
                <div class="text-14-inter dark">Starting at</div>
                <div>
                  <span>$29</span><small class="text-14-inter">/month</small>
                </div>
              </div>
              <button type="button" class="global--qua--button w-full"
                ><img
                  class="btn--icon"
                  src="/assets/icons/arrow-right.svg"
                  alt="" loading="lazy" />See if you Quality</button
              >
              <div class="cancel-text">Cancel Anytime</div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="medicine-card"
            >
              <div class="product-image">
                <Image
                  src={image21}
                  alt="Longevity & Peptides"
                />
              </div>
              <h3>Longevity & Peptides</h3>
              <ul class="feature-list mb-6">
                <li>
                  <span class="list-icon"
                    ><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path
                        d="M9.5 15.5L5.8 11.8L4.4 13.2L9.5 18.3L19.6 8.2L18.2 6.8Z"
                      /></svg></span
