              from website images.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Patient Results Swiper -->
      <section class="patient-results overflow-hidden">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="results-header">
            <div class="section--title mt-2">
              <h2>
                Why patients switch<br /><span class="highlight"
                  >to Freeley</span
                >
              </h2>
            </div>
            <p>
              Real stories from real patients. Names changed for privacy —
              results and timelines are authentic.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="swiper results-grid"
          >
            <div class="swiper-wrapper">
              <div class="swiper-slide">
