                  </div>
                  <h4>Maria K.</h4>
                  <span class="treatment">Semaglutide · Austin, TX</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="swiper-slide">
                <div class="result-card">
                  <div class="weight-loss">-45 lbs</div>
                  <div class="duration">in 4 months</div>
                  <div class="review">
                    &#8220;I couldn&#8217;t believe how easy it was. The medication arrived
                    at my door, and the doctors actually listened. Down 45 lbs
                    and feeling better than ever.&#8221;
                  </div>
                  <h4>James R.</h4>
                  <span class="treatment">Tirzepatide · Portland, OR</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="swiper-slide">
                <div class="result-card">
                  <div class="weight-loss">-28 lbs</div>
                  <div class="duration">in 2.5 months</div>
                  <div class="review">
                    &#8220;After years of struggling with my weight, Freely made it
